From: 6Xkljk8Vj7Tk1k4 <6Xkljk8Vj7Tk1k4@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 20:21:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] gta4xl-common: Add wpa_supplicant_lib to soong namespaces

lib_driver_cmd_slsi lives in its own soong namespace on lineage-24.0,
so wpa_supplicant and hostapd can't resolve
BOARD_WPA_SUPPLICANT_PRIVATE_LIB unless the namespace is exported.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I6c2e5bbbecab56686d31fcb14774307dc8c7b87b
---
 common.mk | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/common.mk b/common.mk
index 64f6db4..1d3499d 100644
--- a/common.mk
+++ b/common.mk
@@ -237,7 +237,8 @@ PRODUCT_SOONG_NAMESPACES += \
     hardware/samsung \
     hardware/samsung_slsi-linaro/exynos/libaudio/audiohal \
     hardware/samsung_slsi-linaro/exynos/gralloc/gralloc3 \
-    hardware/samsung_slsi/libbt
+    hardware/samsung_slsi/libbt \
+    hardware/samsung_slsi/scsc_wifibt/wpa_supplicant_lib
 
 # Task profiles
 PRODUCT_COPY_FILES += \
